  "challenge": "ESCALATE overstates residual ambiguity: VN-001 policy states unknown vendor is the entry point for most fraud, get_vendor_record returned no usable match, and get_vendor_invoice_history is empty—so there is no onboarding trail to verify. Stacked with two IN-001 unknown SKUs (no catalog path to fulfill or price-check), an unverifiable billing domain (VN-003), and PO-002 near-threshold structuring on a round $9,900 total, the packet already matches the fraud signature the policies describe. Human review cannot conjure a master-vendor record or catalog SKUs from this invoice alone; under invoice-adjudication rules the payable decision is REJECT, with any future supplier onboarding handled outside this payment.",
